{"hw":"Πάτροκλος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">Πάτροκλος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Πάτροκλος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Patroclus</cite>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span>, who has also obl. cases from <span class=\"gk\">Πατροκλῆς </span>(<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">-κλέης</span>), viz. gen. <span class=\"gk\">Πατροκλῆος</span>, acc. <span class=\"gk\">Πατροκλῆα</span>, voc. <span class=\"gk\">Πατρόκλεες</span>: gen. pl. <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">Πατρόκλων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1041</span> </span>: nom. <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Πατροκλῆς</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Theoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">15.140</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Πατρόκλεια</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, name of the sixteenth book of the Iliad, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ael.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">VH</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13.14</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eust.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1041.19</span> </span>.</div></div>"}